{"availability":"available","full":"karanshukla/openresto","name":"openresto","description":"A simple, focused booking management system for restaurants, bars, cafes and more. Set up multiple restaurants per instance, and use your own email address to communicate with your customers. Customers get a simple, cross platform, mobile friendly UI to book tables securely. Self host and cloud friendly. ","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":96,"forks":14,"created":"2026-01-28T00:24:26Z","updated":"2026-10-07T13:26:51Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://get.openres.to","topics":["booking","booking-platform","booking-system","docker","dotnet","efcore","expo","management","net","reactnative","restaurant-app","restaurant-management","restaurant-website","restaurants","rms"],"demo":"https://openres.to/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:04.530Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:04.530Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:04.530Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T18:00:04.530Z","stars":96,"forks":14}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Documentation · Live Demo - admin: example@example.com / password · resets every 2 hours, feel free to play around and change anything"],"features":["Real-time table holds — when a customer selects a time slot, a 5-minute hold is placed on the specific table via a thread-safe in-memory ConcurrentDictionary. The holdId must be echoed back at booking time, preventing…","Popular-times categorisation — every 30-minute slot is tagged Lunch, Dinner, or Off-Peak using restaurant industry data (Toast/Square/Yelp benchmarks). The frontend groups available slots into labelled pill tabs so…","Paused bookings — admins can halt new reservations until a specific date/time (e.g. during a private event) without touching any configuration files. The availability API checks BookingsPausedUntil before returning…","IANA timezone awareness — all DateTime values are stored in UTC. Restaurant-local open/close hours and slot generation are computed using the restaurant's IANA timezone (America/NewYork, Europe/London, …), so the…","Multi-restaurant support — manage multiple locations from one instance; each has its own tables, sections, hours, timezone, and branding."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/karanshukla/openresto/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5ef3b91e1f054ca91155de4d091f746689144aebb187f313455fea785c702704","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:04.784Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:04.784Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Documentation · Live Demo - admin: example@example.com / password · resets every 2 hours, feel free to play around and change anything","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/karanshukla/openresto/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Users don't want to install another app, give up their phone number to the cloud, or create another account to remember.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/karanshukla/openresto/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"The full self-hosting guide (install, configuration, HTTPS, email, upgrading, troubleshooting) is at docs.openres.to.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/karanshukla/openresto/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Activity trail — every state-changing admin action, plus sign-ins and failed sign-in attempts, is recorded append-only with who did it, when, from which IP, and a before/after diff.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/karanshukla/openresto/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"API keys & headless CLI — Owners can mint long-lived, individually revocable API keys (Settings → API Keys), each scoped to exactly the resources it needs (bookings, locations, tables, brand, users, audit, guests) — a key without the guests scope reads bookings with customer identity redacted, so a POS or marketing i